Dear {{recipient_name}},

{{apprentice_name}} has completed the practical period and met the gateway requirements for {{standard_title}}.

  Off-the-job hours: {{hours_logged}} of {{hours_target}}
  English and maths: {{functional_skills}}
  Portfolio:         {{portfolio_status}}

Gateway needs your signature as the employer to confirm you agree they are ready. Once that is in, we book the End-Point Assessment with {{epao_name}}, usually within {{epa_lead_time}}.

The assessment is independent of us — we deliver the training, the EPAO judges the outcome.

{{tutor_name}}
{{provider_name}}
